  "note": "POST /sync with notes. Readest upserts notes on (book_hash, id), so the id is the annotation identity and Homebase reuses it verbatim rather than minting its own. Readest's note vocabulary is wider than Homebase's kind, so the original type is stored in sourceKind and replayed on the pull. An id that fails the charset is reported back to the client rather than dropped in silence.",
